    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The procurement is subject to the Act on Public Procurement and Concession Contracts (1397/2016, Procurement Act).
The contracting authority may suspend the procurement procedure in whole or in part for actual and justified reason (Section 125 of the Public Procurement Act).

The tender and the requested certificates and attachments must be submitted in Finnish or English.

PROCESSING OF TENDERS:
The contracting authority:
1. Opens the tenders (the opening ceremony is not public)
2. Checks the requirements for the tenderer based on the information in the ESPD form and the tender form
3 Checks the compliance of the tenders with the call for tenders
4. Compares the tenders
5. Selects the best tender
6. Makes the procurement decision and the decision notification

</cbc:Description>
